stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: checkout started
  pending --> paid: processor says finished, amount matches
  pending --> underpaid: partially_paid
  pending --> failed: failed, or the invoice could not be made
  pending --> expired: not paid in time
  pending --> mismatch: amount or currency differs
  paid --> refunded: processor says refunded (needsReview)
  underpaid --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  expired --> [*]
  mismatch --> [*]
  refunded --> [*]
  paid --> [*]
  note right of paid
    Fulfilment runs once.
    A repeated webhook finds paid and does nothing.
  end note
